{"seq":6,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T22:24:31.972Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"9a2da8e259d5d638046017ef48b37fe3ca4ff23e8b22b1396b5738dbd8e320ae","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Gideon, your first report was at 10:42 AM on 3 Aug (CDT, UTC-5). You posted it here in #inc-vtg-hartford: both inbound lanes at Vantorre's Hartford plant showed a white screen after badge scan.\n\nThe guard was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard from that report until the kiosks came back. Kiosk 1 was back at 11:03 AM, when the guard checked in trailer 8836 and dispatch saw it. You confirmed both lanes working at 11:07 AM, so the manual workaround ran for about 25 minutes.\n\nMateo noted six trucks waiting at the east gate at 10:44 AM. The channel doesn't show when you first noticed the outage, so 10:42 is only the time of your first post. The status-page access problem was tracked separately under INC-4821."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
